{"s":46,"v":[{"t":"Ḥā, Meem.","w":[["حمٓ","Ha Meem","hha-meem",""]]},{"t":"The revelation of the Book is from Allāh, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["تَنزِيلُ","(The) revelation","tanzīlu",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","(of) the Book","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["مِنَ","(is) from","mina",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["ٱلْعَزِيزِ","the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزِ",130]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمِ","the All-Wise","l-ḥakīmi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمِ",133]]]]},{"t":"We did not create the heavens and earth and what is between them except in truth and [for] a specified term. But those who disbelieve, from that of which they are warned, are turning away.","w":[["مَا","Not","mā",""],["خَلَقْنَا","We created","khalaqnā","",[["خَلَقْ",76],["نَا",11]]],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضَ","and the earth","wal-arḍa","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضَ",35]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["بَيْنَهُمَآ","(is) between both of them","baynahumā","",[["بَيْنَ",61],["هُمَآ",66]]],["إِلَّا","except","illā",""],["بِٱلْحَقِّ","in truth","bil-ḥaqi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["حَقِّ",64]]],["وَأَجَلٍۢ","and (for) a term","wa-ajalin","",[["وَ",1],["أَجَلٍۢ",234]]],["مُّسَمًّۭى","appointed","musamman","ۚ"],["وَٱلَّذِينَ","But those who","wa-alladhīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["عَمَّآ","from what","ʿammā","",[["عَ",34],["مَّآ",12]]],["أُنذِرُوا۟","they are warned","undhirū","",[["أُنذِرُ",272],["وا۟",3]]],["مُعْرِضُونَ","(are) turning away","muʿ'riḍūna",""]]},{"t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Have you considered that which you invoke besides Allāh? Show me what they have created of the earth; or did they have partnership in [creation of] the heavens? Bring me a scripture [revealed] before this or a [remaining] trace of knowledge, if you should be truthful.\"","w":[["قُلْ","Say","qul",""],["أَرَءَيْتُم","Do you see","ara-aytum","",[["أَ",31],["رَءَيْ",60],["تُم",4]]],["مَّا","what","mā",""],["تَدْعُونَ","you call","tadʿūna","",[["تَدْعُ",81],["ونَ",4]]],["مِن","besides","min",""],["دُونِ","besides","dūni",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["أَرُونِى","Show me","arūnī","",[["أَرُ",298],["و",4],["نِى",20]]],["مَاذَا","what","mādhā",""],["خَلَقُوا۟","they have created","khalaqū","",[["خَلَقُ",76],["وا۟",3]]],["مِنَ","of","mina",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["أَمْ","or","am",""],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["شِرْكٌۭ","(is) any share","shir'kun",""],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","ۖ",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["ٱئْتُونِى","Bring me","i'tūnī","",[["ٱئْتُ",62],["و",4],["نِى",20]]],["بِكِتَـٰبٍۢ","a book","bikitābin","",[["بِ",10],["كِتَـٰبٍۢ",63]]],["مِّن","from","min",""],["قَبْلِ","before","qabli",""],["هَـٰذَآ","this","hādhā","",[["هَ",0],["ـٰذَآ",69]]],["أَوْ","or","aw",""],["أَثَـٰرَةٍۢ","a trace","athāratin",""],["مِّنْ","of","min",""],["عِلْمٍ","knowledge","ʿil'min",""],["إِن","if","in",""],["كُنتُمْ","you are","kuntum","",[["كُن",21],["تُمْ",4]]],["صَـٰدِقِينَ","truthful","ṣādiqīna",""]]},{"t":"And who is more astray than he who invokes besides Allāh those who will not respond to him until the Day of Resurrection [i.e., never], and they, of their invocation, are unaware.","w":[["وَمَنْ","And who","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَنْ",25]]],["أَضَلُّ","(is) more astray","aḍallu",""],["مِمَّن","than (he) who","mimman","",[["مِ",6],["مَّن",25]]],["يَدْعُوا۟","calls","yadʿū",""],["مِن","besides","min",""],["دُونِ","besides","dūni",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["مَن","who","man",""],["لَّا","will not respond","lā",""],["يَسْتَجِيبُ","will not respond","yastajību",""],["لَهُۥٓ","to him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["إِلَىٰ","until","ilā",""],["يَوْمِ","(the) Day","yawmi",""],["ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","(of) Resurrection","l-qiyāmati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قِيَـٰمَةِ",187]]],["وَهُمْ","and they","wahum","",[["وَ",1],["هُمْ",3]]],["عَن","of","ʿan",""],["دُعَآئِهِمْ","their calls","duʿāihim","",[["دُعَآئِ",471],["هِمْ",3]]],["غَـٰفِلُونَ","(are) unaware","ghāfilūna",""]]},{"t":"And when the people are gathered [that Day], they [who were invoked] will be enemies to them, and they will be deniers of their worship.","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["حُشِرَ","are gathered","ḥushira",""],["ٱلنَّاسُ","the people","l-nāsu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّاسُ",67]]],["كَانُوا۟","they will be","kānū","",[["كَانُ",21],["وا۟",3]]],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["أَعْدَآءًۭ","enemies","aʿdāan",""],["وَكَانُوا۟","and they will be","wakānū","",[["وَ",1],["كَانُ",21],["وا۟",3]]],["بِعِبَادَتِهِمْ","of their worship","biʿibādatihim","",[["بِ",10],["عِبَادَتِ",909],["هِمْ",3]]],["كَـٰفِرِينَ","deniers","kāfirīna",""]]},{"t":"And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who disbelieve say of the truth when it has come to them, \"This is obvious magic.\"","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["تُتْلَىٰ","are recited","tut'lā",""],["عَلَيْهِمْ","to them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["ءَايَـٰتُنَا","Our Verses","āyātunā","",[["ءَايَـٰتُ",39],["نَا",11]]],["بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","clear","bayyinātin",""],["قَالَ","say","qāla",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["لِلْحَقِّ","of the truth","lil'ḥaqqi","",[["لِ",8],["لْ",2],["حَقِّ",64]]],["لَمَّا","when","lammā",""],["جَآءَهُمْ","it comes to them","jāahum","",[["جَآءَ",57],["هُمْ",3]]],["هَـٰذَا","This","hādhā","",[["هَ",0],["ـٰذَا",69]]],["سِحْرٌۭ","(is) a magic","siḥ'run",""],["مُّبِينٌ","clear","mubīnun",""]]},{"t":"Or do they say, \"He has invented it\"? Say, \"If I have invented it, you will not possess for me [the power of protection] from Allāh at all. He is most knowing of that in which you are involved. Sufficient is He as Witness between me and you, and He is the Forgiving, the Merciful.\"","w":[["أَمْ","Or","am",""],["يَقُولُونَ","they say","yaqūlūna","",[["يَقُولُ",16],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ","He has invented it","if'tarāhu","ۖ",[["ٱفْتَرَىٰ",243],["هُ",5]]],["قُلْ","Say","qul",""],["إِنِ","If","ini",""],["ٱفْتَرَيْتُهُۥ","I have invented it","if'taraytuhu","",[["ٱفْتَرَيْ",243],["تُ",20],["هُۥ",5]]],["فَلَا","then not","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَا",13]]],["تَمْلِكُونَ","you have power","tamlikūna","",[["تَمْلِكُ",276],["ونَ",4]]],["لِى","for me","lī","",[["لِ",8],["ى",20]]],["مِنَ","against","mina",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["شَيْـًٔا","anything","shayan","ۖ"],["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["أَعْلَمُ","knows best","aʿlamu",""],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["تُفِيضُونَ","you utter","tufīḍūna","",[["تُفِيضُ",1025],["ونَ",4]]],["فِيهِ","concerning it","fīhi","ۖ",[["فِي",14],["هِ",5]]],["كَفَىٰ","Sufficient is He","kafā",""],["بِهِۦ","Sufficient is He","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["شَهِيدًۢا","(as) a Witness","shahīdan",""],["بَيْنِى","between me","baynī","",[["بَيْنِ",61],["ى",20]]],["وَبَيْنَكُمْ","and between you","wabaynakum","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["بَيْنَ",61],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["ٱلْغَفُورُ","(is) the Oft-Forgiving","l-ghafūru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["غَفُورُ",138]]],["ٱلرَّحِيمُ","the Most Merciful","l-raḥīmu","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحِيمُ",119]]]]},{"t":"Say, \"I am not something original among the messengers, nor do I know what will be done with me or with you. I only follow that which is revealed to me, and I am not but a clear warner.\"","w":[["قُلْ","Say","qul",""],["مَا","Not","mā",""],["كُنتُ","I am","kuntu","",[["كُن",21],["تُ",20]]],["بِدْعًۭا","a new (one)","bid'ʿan",""],["مِّنَ","among","mina",""],["ٱلرُّسُلِ","the Messengers","l-rusuli","",[["ٱل",2],["رُّسُلِ",47]]],["وَمَآ","and not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرِى","I know","adrī",""],["مَا","what","mā",""],["يُفْعَلُ","will be done","yuf'ʿalu",""],["بِى","with me","bī","",[["بِ",10],["ى",20]]],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["بِكُمْ","with you","bikum","ۖ",[["بِ",10],["كُمْ",4]]],["إِنْ","Not","in",""],["أَتَّبِعُ","I follow","attabiʿu",""],["إِلَّا","but","illā",""],["مَا","what","mā",""],["يُوحَىٰٓ","is revealed","yūḥā",""],["إِلَىَّ","to me","ilayya","",[["إِلَىَّ",26],["",20]]],["وَمَآ","and not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَنَا۠","I am","anā",""],["إِلَّا","but","illā",""],["نَذِيرٌۭ","a warner","nadhīrun",""],["مُّبِينٌۭ","clear","mubīnun",""]]},{"t":"Say, \"Have you considered: if it [i.e., the Qur’ān] was from Allāh, and you disbelieved in it while a witness from the Children of Israel has testified to something similar and believed while you were arrogant...?\" Indeed, Allāh does not guide the wrongdoing people.","w":[["قُلْ","Say","qul",""],["أَرَءَيْتُمْ","Do you see","ara-aytum","",[["أَ",31],["رَءَيْ",60],["تُمْ",4]]],["إِن","if","in",""],["كَانَ","it is","kāna",""],["مِنْ","from Allah","min",""],["عِندِ","from Allah","ʿindi",""],["ٱللَّهِ","from Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَكَفَرْتُم","and you disbelieve","wakafartum","",[["وَ",1],["كَفَرْ",53],["تُم",4]]],["بِهِۦ","in it","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَشَهِدَ","and testifies","washahida","",[["وَ",1],["شَهِدَ",274]]],["شَاهِدٌۭ","a witness","shāhidun",""],["مِّنۢ","from","min",""],["بَنِىٓ","(the) Children of Israel","banī",""],["إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","(the) Children of Israel","is'rāīla",""],["عَلَىٰ","to","ʿalā",""],["مِثْلِهِۦ","(the) like thereof","mith'lihi","",[["مِثْلِ",168],["هِۦ",5]]],["فَـَٔامَنَ","then he believed","faāmana","",[["فَ",7],["ـَٔامَنَ",30]]],["وَٱسْتَكْبَرْتُمْ","while you are arrogant","wa-is'takbartum","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["ٱسْتَكْبَرْ",300],["تُمْ",4]]],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["لَا","(does) not","lā",""],["يَهْدِى","guide","yahdī",""],["ٱلْقَوْمَ","the people","l-qawma","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَوْمَ",38]]],["ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","the wrongdoers","l-ẓālimīna","",[["ٱل",2],["ظَّـٰلِمِينَ",108]]]]},{"t":"And those who disbelieve say of those who believe, \"If it had [truly] been good, they would not have preceded us to it.\" And when they are not guided by it, they will say, \"This is an ancient falsehood.\"","w":[["وَقَالَ","And say","waqāla","",[["وَ",1],["قَالَ",16]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["لِلَّذِينَ","of those who","lilladhīna","",[["لِ",8],["لَّذِينَ",17]]],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["لَوْ","If","law",""],["كَانَ","it had been","kāna",""],["خَيْرًۭا","good","khayran",""],["مَّا","not","mā",""],["سَبَقُونَآ","they (would) have preceded us","sabaqūnā","",[["سَبَقُ",509],["و",3],["نَآ",11]]],["إِلَيْهِ","to it","ilayhi","ۚ",[["إِلَيْ",26],["هِ",5]]],["وَإِذْ","And when","wa-idh","",[["وَ",1],["إِذْ",50]]],["لَمْ","not","lam",""],["يَهْتَدُوا۟","they (are) guided","yahtadū","",[["يَهْتَدُ",301],["وا۟",3]]],["بِهِۦ","by it","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["فَسَيَقُولُونَ","they say","fasayaqūlūna","",[["فَ",7],["سَ",118],["يَقُولُ",16],["ونَ",3]]],["هَـٰذَآ","This","hādhā","",[["هَ",0],["ـٰذَآ",69]]],["إِفْكٌۭ","(is) a lie","if'kun",""],["قَدِيمٌۭ","ancient","qadīmun",""]]},{"t":"And before it was the scripture of Moses to lead and as a mercy. And this is a confirming Book in an Arabic tongue to warn those who have wronged and as good tidings to the doers of good.","w":[["وَمِن","And before it","wamin","",[["وَ",1],["مِن",6]]],["قَبْلِهِۦ","And before it","qablihi","",[["قَبْلِ",65],["هِۦ",5]]],["كِتَـٰبُ","(was the) Scripture","kitābu",""],["مُوسَىٰٓ","(of) Musa","mūsā",""],["إِمَامًۭا","(as) a guide","imāman",""],["وَرَحْمَةًۭ","and a mercy","waraḥmatan","ۚ",[["وَ",1],["رَحْمَةًۭ",121]]],["وَهَـٰذَا","And this","wahādhā","",[["وَ",1],["هَ",0],["ـٰذَا",69]]],["كِتَـٰبٌۭ","(is) a Book","kitābun",""],["مُّصَدِّقٌۭ","confirming","muṣaddiqun",""],["لِّسَانًا","(in) language","lisānan",""],["عَرَبِيًّۭا","Arabic","ʿarabiyyan",""],["لِّيُنذِرَ","to warn","liyundhira","",[["لِّ",8],["يُنذِرَ",272]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["ظَلَمُوا۟","do wrong","ẓalamū","",[["ظَلَمُ",123],["وا۟",3]]],["وَبُشْرَىٰ","and (as) glad tidings","wabush'rā","",[["وَ",1],["بُشْرَىٰ",615]]],["لِلْمُحْسِنِينَ","for the good-doers","lil'muḥ'sinīna","",[["لِ",8],["لْ",2],["مُحْسِنِينَ",323]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, those who have said, \"Our Lord is Allāh,\" and then remained on a right course - there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["قَالُوا۟","say","qālū","",[["قَالُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["رَبُّنَا","Our Lord","rabbunā","",[["رَبُّ",24],["نَا",11]]],["ٱللَّهُ","(is) Allah","l-lahu",""],["ثُمَّ","then","thumma",""],["ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟","remain firm","is'taqāmū","",[["ٱسْتَقَـٰمُ",811],["وا۟",3]]],["فَلَا","then no","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَا",13]]],["خَوْفٌ","fear","khawfun",""],["عَلَيْهِمْ","on them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["هُمْ","they","hum",""],["يَحْزَنُونَ","will grieve","yaḥzanūna","",[["يَحْزَنُ",332],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Those are the companions of Paradise, abiding eternally therein as reward for what they used to do.","w":[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","Those","ulāika","",[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["أَصْحَـٰبُ","(are the) companions","aṣḥābu",""],["ٱلْجَنَّةِ","(of) Paradise","l-janati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["جَنَّةِ",92]]],["خَـٰلِدِينَ","abiding forever","khālidīna",""],["فِيهَا","therein","fīhā","",[["فِي",14],["هَا",22]]],["جَزَآءًۢ","a reward","jazāan",""],["بِمَا","for what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["كَانُوا۟","they used to","kānū","",[["كَانُ",21],["وا۟",3]]],["يَعْمَلُونَ","do","yaʿmalūna","",[["يَعْمَلُ",58],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And We have enjoined upon man, to his parents, good treatment. His mother carried him with hardship and gave birth to him with hardship, and his gestation and weaning [period] is thirty months. [He grows] until, whe